      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Review of records and procedures relative to the acquisition, retention and disposition of real property of the City, has revealed the need for more effective management control of this function. To achieve such control, the following procedures will prevail and be used by all Municipal departments and agencies when the need for placing \"holds\" on City property for projects under their jurisdiction becomes necessary.",
